# ─── Byte fidelity ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repository is a checksum-verified archive: 99_MANIFESTS/SHA256SUMS.txt
# must keep verifying after any clone. Disable ALL end-of-line conversion so
# files round-trip byte-for-byte. Diffs still work for textual formats.
* -text

# ─── Git LFS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Scoped deliberately to ONLY the two files that exceed GitHub's 50 MB warning
# threshold. Everything else is stored as normal git objects so that cloning
# this repository never depends on an LFS bandwidth quota. Both of these are
# superseded meshes kept for history.
04_MECHANICAL/SUPERSEDED_AND_MOCKUPS/OVERSIZED_MESHES_500mah_2026-08-22/anticipy-back-half-500mah-c0p35.stl   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
04_MECHANICAL/SUPERSEDED_AND_MOCKUPS/OVERSIZED_MESHES_500mah_2026-08-22/anticipy-front-half-500mah-c0p35.stl  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

